   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ACC305 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 7 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14047 · Decision 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 09/04/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ACC305 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>7 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14047 · QĐ 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 09/04/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Apply established techniques, including appropriate technology for analyzing financial statement information for forecasting, valuation, and risk analysis purposes</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Integrate and apply the major concepts and theories of fundamental analysis and key steps involved in conducting a fundamental analysis and valuation of a company</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Evaluate the impact of financial reporting choices on the quality of accounting information including reported earnings; and assess the quality of accounting information in financial statements.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Use financial statement information in a modeling environment to identify and recommend solutions to a variety of financial challenges</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Analyse and synthesise a firm’s financial statement information in the context of the firm’s economic and business condition to make informed recommendations on investment decisions about the firm</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Show self-reliance when working independently and collaboratively</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Demonstrate ethical awareness and reflection in business context</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14047\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14047</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14047\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14047</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
